{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "20歳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "宮地すみれです。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobbMc1BW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobzyMDiT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おしらせです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日 19:40 ~ 19:50"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "NHK Eテレ ˹理科チューバーズ˼"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最強の空気でっぽう~とじこめた空気(4年)~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Eテレさんの新しい理科の教育番組に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "出演させていただくことになりました︎☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アンミカさん、しんやさんと一緒に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小学校理科の面白さを探究しております。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回は最強の空気でっぽう作りに"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "挑戦しております。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒に楽しく理科を学びましょう︎︎☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私も昔、小学校の授業でNHKさんの"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "教育番組をよく見ていました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "特に ˹歴史にドキリ˼ が大好きで、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "受験勉強の息抜きに兄と歌っていました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "中大兄皇子~♩(伝わってくれてたらいいな)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なので、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回こうして携わらせていただき"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しい気持ちでいっぱいです⸝⸝"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "˹理科チューバーズ˼"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山の方に届いたら幸いです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ ご覧ください💡"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobmU54aa.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてもうひとつ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日 23:06 ~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "テレビ東京"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "˹世の中お金で見てみよう"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "~火曜ヨルの学べる経済~˼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "に出演させていただきます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回は近頃、幅を広げて活躍を見せる"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドローンについて学んでまいりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実際にドローンを持たせていただいたり..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これまで知らなかった裏側を詳しく"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "知ることができて興味深かったです︎☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ ご覧ください✍🏻️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今夜は私と一緒に沢山お勉強しましょう~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おまけ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は自称ドがつくインドアこと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "渡辺莉奈さんと映画を観に行きました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "˹映画ちいかわ 人魚の島のひみつ˼"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なのですが..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とても面白くて、˹観てみて~˼と"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "周りに布教をしている次第であります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "莉奈さんとお揃いで"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "セイレーンTシャツも買っちゃった。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リハでいっぱい着るもん。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobBSxDEe.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobs4Lm2W.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🙂🫶🏻？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは またね。"}], "source": "official"}